  entry
    definition "make normal or cause to conform to a norm or standard"
    examples ("normalize relations with China" "normalize the temperature" "normalize the spelling")
    id oewn-00469149-v
    partOfSpeech v
    synonyms (normalise renormalize renormalise)
  entry
    definition "bring to a desired consistency, texture, or hardness by a process of gradually heating and cooling"
    examples ("temper glass")
    id oewn-00303837-v
    partOfSpeech v
    synonyms (anneal temper)
